{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29075","headline":"听歌鹧鸪辞 · 许浑","name":"听歌鹧鸪辞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南国多情多艳词，鹧鸪清怨遶梁飞。\n甘棠城上客先醉，苦竹岭头人未归。\n响转碧霄云驻影，曲终清漏月沈晖。\n山行水宿不知远，犹梦玉钗金缕衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29075.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29075","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}